user: Users: me, get, search, followers, following, starred, orgs, keys, tokens.
Modes: R read, W write, D destructive (needs confirm). * = required.
me [R] - the authenticated account
get [R] user* - one user or organization profile
search [R] q sort page limit - find users by name, full name or email
followers [R] user page limit - followers of user (default me)
following [R] user page limit - accounts user (default me) follows
starred [R] user page limit - repos starred by user (default me)
orgs [R] user page limit - organizations of user (default me)
keys_list [R] user page limit - SSH keys of user (default me)
keys_add [W] title* key* read_only - add an SSH key to my account
keys_delete [W] id* - remove one of my SSH keys
tokens_list [R] user page limit - access tokens of user (default me), no secrets
tokens_create [W] name* scopes* user repos - create an access token (needs a site-admin token); secret shown once
tokens_delete [W] id* user - delete an access token by id (needs a site-admin token)
help=<action> shows the full parameter list of one action.